{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/T_tYuOyrbOs3oVhiNUzmoQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:17.073961+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/T_tYuOyrbOs3oVhiNUzmoQ","html":"<div><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>中文系“文稿写作”专业硕士学位点</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2027年招生启动！</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、专业简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>随着国家治理体系和治理能力现代化的推进，作为各单位上传下达、沟通协调、传递政令、对外宣传的重要载体，文稿写作的重要性日益凸显，高素质的文稿写作人才成为急需和稀缺人才。为积极回应社会需求，华东师范大学作为学位授权自主审核高校，已增设“文稿写作”硕士专业学位点，第一届（2026年9月入学）招生已经完成。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、培养目标</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>“文稿写作”专业学位点将积极探索“学科交叉、产教融合”的协同育人模式，着力培养“高起点、厚基础、强实践”的文稿写作方面复合型精英人才。本专业旨在培养满足党政机关、企事业单位文稿起草工作要求，具备过硬的政治素养和精湛的写作能力的高素质青年政务人才。</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、师资队伍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>文稿写作专业实行校内校外“双导师”制。我校多个学科的专业老师担任校内导师。校内导师均拥有丰富指导经验。另请党政机关、企事业单位多位拥有丰富政务经验的资深文稿起草专家担任行业导师。</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、培养模式与特色</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>该专业注重实效性和实践性培养，涵盖“会见致辞类文稿”“考察调研类文稿”“日常类文稿”“专题类文稿”“综合类文稿”等多种写作方向，主要以实践成果申请学位。硕士学制3年，除课堂讲授和写作训练外，还将与上海和江浙地区的党政机关和企事业单位共建实践基地，安排学生到相关岗位开展不少于1年的顶岗实习等，在行业导师带领下直接参与文稿调研、起草和写作等相关工作。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、招生方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>本次推免招生打破专业限制，欢迎跨专业报考，欢迎具备较强政治理论素养、较好文字功底、有志于从事相关工作的优秀应届本科毕业生报名。招生规模在18人左右。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>欢迎报考！</span></p><p><span>报名细则参阅以下链接：</span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5OTEyODQwNA==&amp;mid=2650338824&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=1b353de14242fcfd2432b695cbb950b2&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">华东师大中文系2027年接收推荐免试攻读硕士研究生预报名通知</a></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/HJwEYmjers3UP2rnWywKNBlYE1jLOTwsNPjadl94ia1CEmhHDQ7ia57zCqyoTQibGvWxgmveJjFK1Rt9xdibTAx926tLv5bTXibicj0tzVFdTPW8Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"12431d480270